id: settings-int-emptied
section: Settings
item: about:settings: a number field emptied by the keyboard's backspace gives the setting its default back and shows it (it used to write 0, which for the back/forward entries turned Back off)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:settings
kit: cavekit-preferences-ui.md R6
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
tap 'sel:button.pane-tab[data-pane="general"]'
wait rect 'sel:button.pane-tab.on[data-pane="general"]' 5
tap 'sel:.row[data-pref="browser.sessionhistory.max_entries"] input'
expect keyboard up 8
key-hold kb-backspace 1500
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
wait pref i browser.sessionhistory.max_entries 20 6
